sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Merchant as Comerciante
    participant TN as Tiendanube OAuth
    participant App as App Backend Railway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant API as API Tiendanube

    Merchant->>TN: Instalar app 33285
    TN->>App: GET /auth/install opcional
    App->>DB: INSERT oauth_states state CSRF
    App->>TN: Redirect authorize
    TN->>Merchant: Consentimiento OAuth
    Merchant->>TN: Acepta permisos
    TN->>App: GET /auth/callback code state
    App->>DB: consumeOAuthState
    App->>TN: POST authorize/token
    TN-->>App: access_token store_id
    App->>API: GET store info
    API-->>App: nombre URL
    App->>DB: upsert stores
    App->>App: activateStoreScript
    App->>Merchant: Redirect /admin
